      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "27 Beachside Avenue Coastal Living with Excellent Potential\n\nSituated in a desirable coastal location, 27 Beachside Avenue is a charming semi-detached property offering spacious and versatile accommodation, with excellent potential to create a wonderful family home or coastal retreat.\n\nThe property comprises three bedrooms, including a convenient bedroom located on the ground floor, along with a ground-floor shower room and WC. Upstairs, there are two further bedrooms and a main bathroom featuring a bath.\n\nThe home benefits from an open fire and oil-fired central heating, while the rear garden provides valuable outdoor space and scope to create an attractive private garden area for relaxing and entertaining.\n\nIts coastal setting is a particular highlight, offering easy access to the surrounding beaches and countryside while remaining within convenient reach of Gorey and its wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and amenities. The location also provides excellent connectivity for those commuting towards South Dublin, making it an appealing option for both permanent residence and a coastal getaway."
      },
